# Keep the build context small. Everything the cargo build needs is kept:
#   * src/, Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock
#   * MENTISDB_SKILL.md   (include_str! from src/server.rs and src/bin/mentisdb.rs)
#   * benches/            (Cargo.toml declares [[bench]] targets; cargo refuses to
#                          load the manifest when their files are missing)
#   * examples/recall_audit.rs  (Cargo.toml declares it as an [[example]]; same reason)
# Do NOT add any of the above to this file.
# Secrets: never send local env files or keys into the build context.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
**/*keypair*.json
*.p12
*.pfx
# Data and backups: chains, registries, backup archives and the operator key
# directory hold plaintext memory (private segments included) and keys. A copy
# of a data directory lying in the working tree must never end up in an image.
*.mentis
*.mbak
*.tcbin
*.bak
**/*~
.env~
results/
promo/
operator/
tls/
mentisdb-registry.json
mentisdb-webhooks.json
mentisdb-skills.bin
target/
**/target/
.git/
.github/
.claude/
.fastembed_cache/
data/
docs/
examples/*
!examples/recall_audit.rs
tests/
lme-benches/
locomo-benches/
pymentisdb/
scripts/
skills/
*.tex
*.pdf
WHITEPAPER.*
build-whitepaper.sh
ROADMAP.md
AGENTS.md
changelog.txt
code-performance-reviewer.md
start_mentisdb
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
